{"sha": "a5f3723505dbca4e8fe87b0a9cee9c87e7d7bce335f8c45b7fec2fde20bcf676", "body": ["{\\small 左：两端固定的弦的前三个模式（$f_n = nc/2L$）。", "右：在中点处拨动的弦（三角形）及其傅里叶级数的前几项", "--- 只出现奇次谐波，振幅", "按 $1/n^2$ 衰减。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[梅尔德实验]\\label{ex:b2:waves-on-strings:melde}", "\\index{梅尔德实验}", "弦的一端由振动器以频率 $f$ 驱动，另一端", "绕过滑轮悬挂质量为 $m$ 的物体（故 $T = mg$），每当 $f$ 等于", "某个 $f_n = (n/2L)", "\\sqrt{mg/\\mu}$ 时，便出现很大的驻波 --- 即第 $n$ 个模式的共振。取 $L = \\qty{1.2}{m}$，$\\mu =", "\\qty{1.0}{g/m}$，$f = \\qty{50}{Hz}$，得到 $n = 1, 2, 3$ 个波腹时的质量为", "$m_n = 4L^2f^2\\mu/n^2g = 1.47/n^2$ kg：\\qty{1.47}{kg}、\\qty{367}{g}、\\qty{163}{g}。", "吉他弦在第十二品处按压时，$L$ 减半，", "$f_1$ 加倍，即八度音程；在中点处轻触而不按压，", "则消去奇次模式，只留下二次谐波 --- 即泛音。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{能量、功率与阻抗}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[弦波的能量]\\label{prop:b2:waves-on-strings:energy}", "\\index{能量密度（弦）}\\index{能流（弦）}\\index{阻抗（弦）}", "弦携带单位长度的能量和功率（能流", "沿 $+x$ 方向）", "\\[", "e = \\tfrac12\\mu\\Bigl(\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial t}\\Bigr)^2 + \\tfrac12T\\Bigl(\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x}\\Bigr)^2 ,", "\\qquad", "\\mathcal P = -T\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x}\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial t} ,", "\\]", "它们满足局域守恒关系 $\\partial_te + \\partial_x\\mathcal P = 0$。对于行波", "$y = f(x - ct)$，动能密度与势能密度", "相等，且 $\\mathcal P = Z\\,(\\partial_ty)^2$，其中", "\\[", "Z = \\sqrt{T\\mu} = \\mu c = \\frac Tc ,", "\\]", "称为弦的\\emph{阻抗}（单位为 \\unit{kg/s}）：它是", "弦对其前方物体施加的横向力 $-T\\partial_xy$", "与横向速度 $\\partial_ty$ 之比。振幅为 $A$ 的正弦波", "携带的平均功率为 $\\langle\\mathcal P\\rangle = \\tfrac12Z\\omega^2A^2$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "势能项是张力拉伸微元所做的功：", "其长度为", "\\[", "\\dd x\\sqrt{1 + (\\partial_xy)^2} \\approx \\dd x\\bigl(1 + \\tfrac12(\\partial_xy)^2\\bigr) ,", "\\]", "因此多出的长度乘以 $T$ 得 $\\tfrac12T(\\partial_xy)^2\\dd x$。穿过 $x$ 处、沿 $+x$ 方向传递的功率", "为左侧部分作用于右侧部分的横向力", "$-T\\partial_xy$ 乘以速度", "$\\partial_ty$。由守恒律得：", "\\[", "\\partial_te = \\mu\\,\\partial_ty\\,\\partial_t^2y + T\\,\\partial_xy\\,\\partial_x\\partial_ty ,", "\\qquad", "-\\partial_x\\mathcal P = T\\,\\partial_x^2y\\,\\partial_ty + T\\,\\partial_xy\\,\\partial_x\\partial_ty ,", "\\]", "由波动方程，二者相等。对于 $f(x - ct)$：$\\partial_xy = -\\partial_ty/c$，故 $\\mathcal P = (T/c)", "(\\partial_ty)^2$ 且两种密度均等于 $\\tfrac12\\mu(\\partial_ty)^2$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[节点处的反射与透射]\\label{prop:b2:waves-on-strings:junction}", "\\index{反射系数（弦）}\\index{透射系数（弦）}", "振幅为 $A_i$ 的波从阻抗为 $Z_1$ 的弦", "入射到阻抗为 $Z_2$、在 $x = 0$ 处相接的弦上。节点处的", "位移与横向力的连续性给出", "振幅系数", "\\[", "r = \\frac{A_r}{A_i} = \\frac{Z_1 - Z_2}{Z_1 + Z_2} , \\qquad", "t = \\frac{A_t}{A_i} = \\frac{2Z_1}{Z_1 + Z_2} ,", "\\]", "以及能量比 $R = r^2$、$\\mathcal T = 4Z_1Z_2/(Z_1 + Z_2)^2$，且", "$R + \\mathcal T = 1$。固定端（$Z_2 \\to \\infty$）以 $r = -1$ 反射", "（脉冲倒立返回），自由端（$Z_2 = 0$）以 $r = +1$ 反射；", "阻抗相等时则全部透射。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "正弦波 $y_1 = A_i\\cos(\\omega t - k_1x) + A_r\\cos(\\omega t + k_1x)$（$x < 0$）；", "$y_2 = A_t\\cos(\\omega t - k_2x)$（$x > 0$），两侧的 $\\omega$ 相同。", "在 $x = 0$ 处：由 $y_1 = y_2$ 得 $A_i + A_r = A_t$；横向力 $-T\\partial_xy$", "连续（节点无质量）得 $Z_1(A_i - A_r) = Z_2A_t$（利用", "$T_1k_1 = Z_1\\omega$）。解之即可。能量：平均功率为 $\\tfrac12Z\\omega^2A^2$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[->] (-3.2,0) -- (3.2,0) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$x$};", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick, domain=-3.0:0, samples=50] plot (\\x,{0.8*exp(-(\\x+1.6)^2/0.25)});", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick, domain=0:3.0, samples=50] plot (\\x,{0});", "    \\fill (0,0) circle (2pt); \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.35) {$Z_1 \\to Z_2$};", "    \\draw[omDef, ->, thick] (-1.6,1.0) -- (-0.8,1.0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize, pos=0.5] {$A_i$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (-1.5,-0.6) {$Z_1$}; \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (1.5,-0.6) {$Z_2 > Z_1$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.1) {前};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.2cm]", "    \\draw[->] (-3.2,0) -- (3.2,0) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$x$};", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick, domain=-3.0:0, samples=50] plot (\\x,{-0.27*exp(-(\\x+1.6)^2/0.25)});", "    \\draw[omProp, very thick, domain=0:3.0, samples=50] plot (\\x,{0.53*exp(-(\\x-1.1)^2/0.12)});", "    \\fill (0,0) circle (2pt);", "    \\draw[omThm, ->, thick] (-1.0,0.5) -- (-1.8,0.5) node[above, font=\\footnotesize, pos=0.5] {$rA_i$};", "    \\draw[omProp, ->, thick] (1.0,0.9) -- (1.8,0.9) node[above, font=\\footnotesize, pos=0.5] {$tA_i$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.1) {后：$r = \\dfrac{Z_1 - Z_2}{Z_1 + Z_2}$，$t = \\dfrac{2Z_1}{Z_1 + Z_2}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 脉冲遇到一个较重弦的节点（$Z_2 = 4Z_1$）：", "部分透射，速度更慢、宽度更窄；部分倒立反射。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}